<title>USA: Crescent Real Estate expands stock offer.</title>
<headline>Crescent Real Estate expands stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crescent Real Estate Equities Inc said on Friday it has elected to increase the size of its offering to 10 million shares from 5.5 million.</p>
<p>Crescent said the offering will raise proceeds of approximately $404 million to fund certain pending acquisitions, future acquisitions and to partially repay short-term borrowings to be assumed from pending acquisitions.</p>
</text>
